{"3776540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roadtrip: The Engine of Madness", "steam_appid": 3776540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman wakes up in an unknown room, with no recollection of who she is, where she is, and how she got there. There are some personal items in the room, but are they hers or was someone else trapped in here before?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no way out, the only thing she can do is play a mysterious cassette tape that opens up a video game world full of odd sights and creeping horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through a desolate alternate Spain, where you scavenge fuel and car parts to repair your vehicle, the only thing that can save you from the monsters that prowl the everlasting night. Discover what happened in the area, what the corpse on the passenger seat has to do with it, and how all that is connected to the events that unfurl in the outside world. Inspired by classics of the horror genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO GRAPHICS WITH A PERSONAL TOUCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of PSX era graphics and bicolor visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE DRIVING WITH HIGHLY REALISTIC SENSATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776540/extras/0dec8af629a1cbdc515dca68da3ba1f8.poster.avif?t=1757677431\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776540/extras/0dec8af629a1cbdc515dca68da3ba1f8.webm?t=1757677431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776540/extras/0dec8af629a1cbdc515dca68da3ba1f8.mp4?t=1757677431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the keys, remove the handbrake, flick through radio channels and shift gears for an immersive driving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TONS OF INTERACTIONS WITH THE WORLD AND YOUR CAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your car breaks down, sneak out and find repair parts before the monsters find you! Break into abandoned houses, search through what people left behind—and get out while you still can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WEIRD STORY OF HORROR AND MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776540/extras/2bbbf8caafe61d7a1f45422df547933b.poster.avif?t=1757677431\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776540/extras/2bbbf8caafe61d7a1f45422df547933b.webm?t=1757677431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776540/extras/2bbbf8caafe61d7a1f45422df547933b.mp4?t=1757677431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two dimensions, one reality. Investigate the strange correlations between the room and the game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman wakes up in an unknown room, with no recollection of who she is, where she is, and how she got there. There are some personal items in the room, but are they hers or was someone else trapped in here before?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no way out, the only thing she can do is play a mysterious cassette tape that opens up a video game world full of odd sights and creeping horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through a desolate alternate Spain, where you scavenge fuel and car parts to repair your vehicle, the only thing that can save you from the monsters that prowl the everlasting night. Discover what happened in the area, what the corpse on the passenger seat has to do with it, and how all that is connected to the events that unfurl in the outside world. Inspired by classics of the horror genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO GRAPHICS WITH A PERSONAL TOUCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of PSX era graphics and bicolor visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE DRIVING WITH HIGHLY REALISTIC SENSATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776540/extras/0dec8af629a1cbdc515dca68da3ba1f8.poster.avif?t=1757677431\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776540/extras/0dec8af629a1cbdc515dca68da3ba1f8.webm?t=1757677431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776540/extras/0dec8af629a1cbdc515dca68da3ba1f8.mp4?t=1757677431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the keys, remove the handbrake, flick through radio channels and shift gears for an immersive driving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TONS OF INTERACTIONS WITH THE WORLD AND YOUR CAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your car breaks down, sneak out and find repair parts before the monsters find you! Break into abandoned houses, search through what people left behind—and get out while you still can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WEIRD STORY OF HORROR AND MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p